T:808 Pattern Demo — the KRS Foundation Grid (drum sheet)
% Struck with the pattern it notates, 24 November 2026.
% Grid: 144 BPM, 13/8 Sigma Mega (the KRS foundation).
% Legend: V:1 C, = the 808 kick, dial-tuned to VV (placed 44 Hz).
% V:2 c = snare; g = hi-hat (closed; the bar-final g of each bar
% is the open hat, per the pattern record in manifest.json).
% '808' names the TR-808 sound family; every voice is synthesized
% in-house by resonance/studio/eightoeight.py.
M:13/8
L:1/8
Q:1/4=144
K:C
V:1 clef=bass
C, z z C, z z C, z z z C, z z | C, z z C, z z C, z z z C, z z |
V:2
z g z g c g z g z g z [cg] g | z g z g c g z g z g z [cg] g |
